There's been a murder! Look for clues to help solve the case.

{% responsive_image path: assets/img/the-murder.png %}

At 9 p.m., the maid enters Mr Blackwood’s study to pick up the glass from Mr
Blackwood’s nightcap. She knocks on the door. No answer. She knocks again.
Still no answer. She opens the door to find Mr Blackwood dead on the floor and
the drink spilled on the rug. It was a shame, as the rug really tied the room
together.

